WEBVTT

00:07:59.099 --> 00:08:00.684
And there's one particular reason

00:08:00.684 --> 00:08:03.812
as to why my team and I decided
to call the game the 5 STA-Z.

00:08:03.812 --> 00:08:06.899
And it's simply the conviction
that no matter where you're from

00:08:06.941 --> 00:08:09.360
and the current existing circumstances,

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.445
we can all reach for the stars.

00:08:12.196 --> 00:08:14.615
And like Neil deGrasse Tyson would put it,

00:08:14.615 --> 00:08:16.700
not only do we live among the stars,

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.994
the stars themselves live within us.

00:08:19.036 --> 00:08:21.664
And that includes children
from refugee camps.

00:08:22.206 --> 00:08:24.333
And as children also start
playing the game,

00:08:24.375 --> 00:08:26.627
we encourage them
not to use their actual names,

00:08:26.669 --> 00:08:31.590
but actually to take on the characters
of the five brightest stars in the galaxy.